he new Settings surface.\n- Settings labels and guides describe the new pages and account actions.\n</details>\n\n<!-- greptile_confidence_score:5 -->\n\n<sub>Reviews (16) · Last reviewed commit: [\"Use supported paste binding in preview f...\"](https://github.com/maus-inc/mausvoice/commit/3f6d003fc6df33e44b7b65e8852333bae2240eb5) · [Reviewed by Greptile](https://www.greptile.com/?utm_source=greptile_review&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=review_public&utm_content=maus-inc/mausvoice)</sub>\n\n<!-- /greptile_comment -->\n\n## Browser-preview visual evidence\n\n[Screenshot index and coverage notes](https://github.com/maus-inc/mausVoice/blob/7c263e1/.qa/pr288/README.md) · [All captures](https://github.com/maus-inc/mausVoice/blob/e90dd0e/.qa/pr288)\n\nCaptured with synthetic preview data at 1200×800 and 400×300 in light and dark themes: all eight settings routes plus home, history, dictionary, styles, help and chat; representative dialogs, the overview tooltip, welcome and an onboarding step. The index documents the route checks, corrected account-dialog selectors, and what was visually inspected.\n\nThese captures are representative, not exhaustive verification of every changed state. Native WebView, real audio and IME, global shortcuts, cross-window behavior, and the requested 140+ individually verified edge cases / 100 distinct issue-derived cases remain unverified. The model dialog shows browser-preview native-API limitations.\n\n<details><summary>Selected screenshots</summary>\n\n**Overview and shortcut tooltip**\n\n![Overview tooltip](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maus-inc/mausVoice/e90dd0e/.qa/pr288/overview-tooltip-light-1200x800.jpg)\n\n**Account**\n\n![Account](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maus-inc/mausVoice/e90dd0e/.qa/pr288/account-dark-1200x800.jpg)\n\n**Compact profile dialog**\n\n![Profile dialog](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maus-inc/mausVoice/e90dd0e/.qa/pr288/dialog-profile-dark-400x300.jpg)\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n### Settings surface refine