+      "description": "## Summary\nClippy 1.98 promotes `chunks_exact_to_as_chunks` to deny. The Lint Desktop workflow pins `dtolnay/rust-toolchain@stable`, so the bump broke the macOS, Windows, and Linux lint jobs on every branch with no source change. This PR rewrites the three affected call sites to use `slice::as_chunks` (stabilized in Rust 1.80) so the lint passes again.\n\n## Affected sites\n- `apps/desktop/src-tauri/src/utils/encoding.rs:4,10` — UTF-16 LE and BE byte pairing\n- `apps/desktop/src-tauri/src/platform/linux/audio.rs:283` — F32LE sample conversion\n\n## Why this is safe\n- `as_chunks::<N>()` returns a `(&[[T; N]], &[T])` pair, where the remainder is dropped, identical to the previous `chunks_exact(N).map(...)` behaviour.\n- The byte conversion now takes the `[T; N]` array by value (`*c` / `*chunk`) instead of indexing the chunk.\n- Existing tests in `encoding.rs` cover UTF-8 with/without BOM, UTF-16 LE, and UTF-16 BE and continue to apply unchanged.\n\n## Verification\n- `git diff --check` clean.\n- Local `cargo clippy` not run in this sandbox (no Rust toolchain available). The CI Lint Desktop workflow is the source of truth.\n- Build matrix (macOS, Windows, Linux) will re-validate via the existing CI pipeline.\n\n## Root cause investigation\nLint Desktop passed on `54667294` (2026-08-19) and started failing on `18d9efea` (2026-08-26). No source changes in `apps/desktop/src-tauri/**` between those two commits — the failure was triggered purely by clippy 1.98 reaching stable. This PR does not pin the toolchain; a follow-up could pin the toolchain to make the lint deterministic.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Affected files</summary>\n\n```\n apps/desktop/src-tauri/src/platform/linux/audio.rs |  6 ++++--\n apps/desktop/src-tauri/src/utils/encoding.rs       | 12 ++++++++----\n 2 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)\n```\n</details>\n\nMausAgent | Filed by kilo/minimax/minimax-m3:free, with @Owie6789, on 2026-09-01\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nBug Fixes:\n- Update byte-pair and audio sample processing to satisfy the newly denied Clippy `chunks_exact_to_as_chunks` lint."
