ranscript indexing; rename a shadowed loop variable to avoid redeclaration.\n- scripts/ci/generate-release-body.mjs: replace `.filter(Boolean)[0]` with `.find(Boolean)` for previous-tag selection.\n- personal-fork CI: keep templates in sync with desktop workflows; keep `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` (with `# NOSONAR`) to ensure required postinstall builds run. No migration required.\n\n**Verification**\n- SonarCloud rules that previously flagged the touched files now report zero findings.\n- CI contracts and YAML parsing pass; canvas output matches across animated and reduced-motion paths.\n\n<sup>Written for commit 81b7a0c2c0e1e1239d0d9715962bb94927ac9ebe. Summary will update on new commits.</sup>\n\n<a href=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/maus-inc/mausVoice/pull/122?utm_source=github\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Review in cubic\" src=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n"
