+      "description": "## Summary\n\nStacked on `arena/01a01a61-mausvoice` (PR #105). Finishes the leftover kilo-code-bot review items that were still valid on the tip of that branch.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **A04 italics:** `ITALIC_RE` now uses zero-width `(?<![\\w*])` / `(?![\\w*])` so surrounding text is not consumed and `*emphasized*.`, `*emphasized*,`, and `(*emphasized*)` strip correctly.\n- **A04 images:** Detect `!` *before* `[` so `![alt](url)` becomes `alt`, not `alt (url)`.\n- **Thock throttle:** `saturating_sub` avoids `SystemTime` underflow; comment matches the min-interval gate.\n- **Windows keepalive:** `set_webview_keepalive(false)` only after `is_visible()`.\n- **Context menu keys:** `item-{index}-{label}` so duplicate labels cannot collide.\n\nThe interaction-chime command wiring from the earlier review is already on the base branch (`set_interaction_chime_enabled` in `commands.rs` / `app.rs` / `AppSideEffects.tsx`).\n\n## Tests\n\n- Extended `assistant-pill-text.utils.test.ts` for punctuation-adjacent italics and markdown images.\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nFinish the remaining review fixes for markdown parsing, window keepalive, audio throttling, and context-menu stability.\n\nBug Fixes:\n- Correct markdown pill-text handling for punctuation-adjacent italics and image links.\n- Prevent audio throttle time underflow when the system clock moves backwards.\n- Keep Windows WebView2 keepalive enabled until the window is confirmed visible.\n- Ensure context-menu item keys remain unique when labels are duplicated.\n\nTests:\n- Add coverage for punctuation-adjacent italic markdown parsing.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n---\n## Summary by cubic\nFinishes remaining review items for pill text parsing, Windows keepalive, thock throttling, and context menu keys. Improves markdown stripping accuracy and prevents background JS stalls and time underflow.\n\n**Behavior changes**\n- Italics parsing: Previously ate adjacent punctuation or missed cases; now uses zero‑width word/asterisk boundaries so \"*emphasized*.\", \"(*emphasized*)\", and \"*emphasized*, next\" strip correctly while intra‑word stars (is*not*) remain literal.\n- Image links: Previously converted `![alt](url)` to \"alt (url)\"; now detects the leading `!` and outputs \"alt\".\n- Thock throttle: Previously could underflow when system time moved backwards; now uses `saturating_sub`, keeping the 100 ms gate stable under clock skew.\n- Windows keepalive: Previously cleared keepalive even if the window stayed hidden after show/unminimize; now clears only when `is_visible()` is true, so background JS continues until the window is visible.\n- Context menu keys: Previously used label-only keys that collided with duplicate labels; now prefixes keys with the item index to ensure uniqueness.\n\n<sup>Written for commit 32b5558bea4088c7e9c938a6799d6924d4ab56eb. Summary will update on new commits.</sup>\n\n<a href=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/maus-inc/mausVoice/pull/114?utm_source=github\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Review in cubic\" src=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n"
