and style hotkey editing were always available; now they are hidden or disabled when post‑processing is off, and related actions run with `toneId: null`.\n\n- Shared selector: add `isPostProcessingEnabled` (resolved from generation prefs) and cover keyless providers (e.g., `ollama`, `openai-compatible`) in tests.\n- Style Hotkeys dialog: disable editing and Save when unavailable, show the existing explanatory tooltip, stop hotkey recording if turned off while open, and suppress conflict warnings while disabled.\n- Import Audio and Retranscribe: hide the Style field when unavailable and force action payloads to `toneId: null`; UI updates live if availability changes during an open dialog.\n- Tests: new unit tests for the selector and UI gating across Style Hotkeys, Import Audio, and Retranscribe.\n\n<sup>Written for commit e83c98c7e17d2066a20b4bd8e4ed670bd2f77d21. Summary will update on new commits.</sup>\n\n<a href=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/maus-inc/mausVoice/pull/93?utm_source=github\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Review in cubic\" src=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n"
