+      "description": "Cherry-pick of PR #87 onto `fix/superfix-review-findings` (PR #63).\n\nThis recreates the changes from PR #87 (commits 8cfcb4f and 2a84a30) which were reverted in #88, now re-applied on top of current `fix/superfix-review-findings` tip (22594fb).\n\nChanges included:\n- Adds debug-assist Cargo feature gating devtools (`apps/desktop/src-tauri/Cargo.toml`)\n- Gates devtools opening behind #[cfg(feature = \"debug-assist\")] (`app.rs`)\n- Updates local dev/debug build scripts to pass --features debug-assist (`apps/desktop/package.json`)\n- Adds A06_DEV_SURFACES_HANDOFF.md\n- Adds smol-toml devDependency and ci contract tests (`scripts/ci/dev-surface-*`)\n\nTargets `fix/superfix-review-findings` (PR #63), same as original PR #87.\nAlso available on branch `arena/01a017af-mausvoice` (this session branch) which is identical.\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nGate desktop DevTools behind an explicit debug-assist feature so inspection remains available for QA artifacts while being excluded from stable binaries.\n\nBug Fixes:\n- Restrict desktop DevTools compilation and startup access to opt-in QA and development artifacts, preventing stable binaries from exposing the inspection capability.\n\nEnhancements:\n- Add contract tests and shared configuration to verify DevTools feature gating and local build opt-ins.\n\nBuild:\n- Enable the debug-assist feature in local desktop development and debug build commands.\n- Add smol-toml as a development dependency for Cargo manifest contract validation.\n\nDocumentation:\n- Add handoff documentation for applying the corresponding workflow and release-artifact gating changes.\n\nTests:\n- Add CI contract tests covering Cargo, Rust startup, and local build DevTools gating.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n---\n## Summary by cubic\nRestricts desktop DevTools to QA artifacts by gating Tauri inspection behind a compile-time `debug-assist` feature. Previously DevTools were compiled into all builds