+      "description": "## Summary\n\nFixes all 50 issues reported by [CodeFactor](https://www.codefactor.io/repository/github/maus-inc/mausvoice/issues) for this repository — duplicate code blocks, complex methods, unresolved TODOs, Python URL-open audit findings, and a couple of PowerShell/shell script issues. All changes are behavior-preserving refactors.\n\n### Duplicate codelines (16 issues)\n- **New shared components** extracted from duplicated JSX:\n  - `DialogTitleWithClose` — `AIAgentModeDialog` + `AIPostProcessingDialog`\n  - `FreeSoloModelAutocomplete` — `GroqModelPicker` + `OllamaModelPicker`\n  - `PermissionAccessButton`, `OnboardingFormHeader`, `OnboardingContinueButton` — onboarding forms (`ChooseLlmForm`, `ChooseTranscriptionForm`, `UserDetailsForm`, `MicPermsForm`, `A11yPermsForm`)\n  - `ReleasePageLayout` — `FeatureReleaseDialog`\n  - `TutorialWindow` + `NotesStep`/`EmailStep` — `TutorialForm`\n  - `ApiKeyFormActions` — `ApiKeyList`\n  - `ToggleRow` — `AIAgentModeDialog`\n  - `ModelMetaText` — `AITranscriptionConfiguration`\n- **`createAudioChunkPump`** — the 47-line duplicate WebSocket audio chunking/flushing logic shared by `assemblyai-transcription-session.ts` and `deepgram-transcription-session.ts` now lives in one place.\n\n### Complex methods (24 issues)\nExtracted helpers so no method exceeds the cyclomatic-complexity threshold, with identical logic:\n- `storeTranscription` (complexity 39) → 6 small helpers\n- `stopRecordingRaw` (`DictationSideEffects`), Mixpanel tracking effect (`AppSideEffects`)\n- `retranscribeTranscription`, `findOverlap`, `applyReplacements`, `fromLocalUser`\n- `getGenTextRepoInternal` → builder-registry map (`repos/index.ts`)\n- `TutorialForm`, `MultiDeviceDialog` (4 sub-components), `HotkeySetting`, `UpdateDialog`, `MicrophoneTester`\n- `useHotkeyFire` (`packages/desktop-utils`)\n- `claudeStreamChat`, `openaiCompatibleStreamChat`, `geminiStreamChat` (`packages/voice-ai`)\n- Long `if`-chains replaced with lookup tables: key-name aliases (`helper.hooks.ts`), whisper model aliases (`local-transcription.utils.ts`)\n\n### Security / audit (10 issues)\n- **B310 url-open findings**: all `urllib` `urlopen`/`urlretrieve` calls in `scripts/prompts.py`, `scripts/app-icons.py`, and `packages/rust_transcription/benchmark.py` now validate the scheme (http/https only) via a shared `assert_http_url()` helper before opening. Verified with Bandit (0 B310 findings remaining).\n- **PowerShell** (`stress-overlay-windows.ps1`): renamed the automatic `$matches` variable to `$logMatches` (PSScriptAnalyzer warning) and replaced the empty `catch` block with `Write-Verbose`.\n\n### Misc (2 issues)\n- Removed stale `TODO` comment in `utils/user.utils.ts`.\n- `echo` of escape-sequence payloads → `printf '%s\\n'` in the three pill `test.sh` scripts (ShellCheck SC2028).\n\n## Verification\n- `pnpm --filter desktop check-types` ✅\n- `pnpm --filter desktop lint` (Prettier + oxlint, 373 files): 0 warnings/errors ✅\n- Desktop unit tests: **365 passed**; the only failures are pre-existing integration/evals tests requiring `GROQ_API_KEY`/`OPENAI_API_KEY` environment variables (not available in CI-less sandbox, untouched by this change)\n- All workspace packages build (`types`, `utilities`, `desktop-utils`, `voice-ai`, `agent`, `desktop-native-apis`) + desktop Vite production build ✅\n- Bandit on the Python scripts: 0 B310 findings ✅\n- `bash -n` on the modified `test.sh` scripts ✅\n\n## Notes\n- No behavioral changes intended — purely structural refactors; unit tests cover the refactored utilities (`string.utils`, `transcribe.utils`, etc.).\n- CodeFactor analyzes `main`; once merged the issue count should drop to 0.\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- **New Features**\n  - Added reusable onboarding controls for consistent headers, continue actions, and permission access states.\n  - Added free-form model selection for supported AI providers.\n  - Added clearer multi-device delivery diagnostics and pairing invite import/copy options.\n  - Added reusable dialog close controls and standardized settings actions.\n\n- **Improvements**\n  - Improved streaming transcription reliability, audio handling, finalization, and warning reporting.\n  - Improved transcription and preference value handling for more consistent saved settings.\n  - Added safer validation for network requests used by supported tools.\n\n- **Refactor**\n  - Consolidated shared UI patterns and transcription workflows without changing existing behavior.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->"
