+      "description": "## Summary\n\nComprehensive dependency update for the monorepo, in three parts:\n\n### 1. In-range updates (everything bumped to latest within its semver range)\nReact 19.2.4 → 19.2.8, @types/react 19.2.18, MUI 7.3.9 → 7.3.11 (superseded by v9, see below), turbo/prettier/oxlint, @wdio 9.27 → 9.30, @formatjs/cli 6.14 → 6.16, TS 5.9.3 in packages, eslint 9.39.5, typescript-eslint 8.67, astro 5.18.2, plus fontsource, dayjs, lucide, morphicons, mixpanel-browser and more. Prettier 3.9 reformatted 10 files (union-type rules).\n\n### 2. Major upgrades (with migrations done properly)\n\n| Package | From → To | Migration work |\n|---|---|---|\n| @mui/material, @mui/system, @mui/icons-material, @mui/lab | 7.x → 9.x | Ran official `@mui/codemod` `v9.0.0/system-props` + deprecation codemods across `apps/desktop/src`; hand-fixed the rest: renamed `*Outline` → `*Outlined` icons, `InputProps`/`inputProps` → `slotProps`, Menu `PaperProps` → `slotProps.paper`, removed `disableEscapeKeyDown` (now guarded via `onClose` reason), fixed motion-wrapped components and a latent `Logo` props bug exposed by the codemod |\n| zod | 3.25 → 4.4.3 | Desktop, `@maus-inc/types`, `@maus-inc/voice-ai`. Added `zod-to-json-schema>zod: >=4.0.0` override so its types resolve against zod 4; one documented type-boundary cast at the conversion site |\n| firebase | 11.10 → 12.17 | No API changes needed (v12 breaking changes are all in beta APIs); widened `@maus-inc/firemix` peer to `^11 \\|\\| ^12` |\n| astro + @astrojs/starlight | 5.18 → 7.2 / 0.37 → 0.41 | Migrated the sidebar config from the removed `autogenerate` + `label` shape to the v0.39+ `items` shape |\n| @stripe/react-stripe-js, @stripe/stripe-js | 3.10/7.9 → 6.8/9.13 | Peer-compatible, no code changes |\n| pnpm (packageManager) | 10.11.0 → 10.34.5 | Lockfile regenerated; Node engines raised to >=20 (cross-env 10 requirement) |\n| @vitejs/plugin-react, vite-plugin-svgr | 4 → 5 | Peer-compatible with pinned Vite 7 |\n| cross-e