+      "description": "## 0.1.6 — status: in progress (WIP)\n\nWorking branch for the 0.1.6 release. Implementation follows `docs/0.1.6-release-plan.md` (full spec + log-correlated evidence in §15).\n\n### Landed so far\n- **Phase 6 — light mode fixed.** The pre-hydration inline `body.style.backgroundColor` outranked MUI's CssBaseline forever (the \"hardcoded dark\" bug); now a boot class cleared on mount, and `colorSchemeStorageKey` aligns MUI with the bootstrap key (incl. `mui-mode` migration).\n- **Phase 3 — mausVoice Cloud + enterprise + pricing removed.** Cloud AI dispatch, `packages/functions`, all `Cloud*`/`Enterprise*` repos, pricing/payment/trial UI, OIDC/SSO, enterprise routing, `is_enterprise` (migration 072), cloud modes rewritten to local/none/none (migration 071). Repo factories are now local/personal only; remote-device sessions mount ungated. (−5,661 lines)\n- **Phase 3.3 — assistant switcher:** API/Off only, SegmentedControl shared-layout slide animation (scoped `layoutId` + `springSnappy`, reduced-motion fallback).\n- **Phase 5 — switches + sliders.** Square switches app-wide via MUI theming; new `ElasticSlider` (MUI + framer-motion, Maus Voice palette); drag-sync fix: local state during drag, persist on commit only.\n- **Phase 8 — dictation stability.** Recording start/abort race fixed (`onRecordingStart` null crash from logs); try/finally phase convergence; 90s/60s watchdogs on finalize + post-processing; phase seq numbers + write retries over the pill pipe with stale-write guards in all three pill crates; deterministic cleanup + `pasteQueue` reset; idle-reconciliation heartbeat; truncated-LLM JSON repair.\n\n### Verified\n`tsc --noEmit` exit 0 · oxlint 0/0 · prettier clean · vitest 68/68. Rust changes are compile-verified in CI only (no Rust toolchain in the authoring sandbox).\n\n### Remaining (next up, tracked in the plan)\n- Phase 7: local-transcription resilience (`session_not_found` → batch fallback, sidecar activity lease, skip GPU sidecar when none detected) + spec-based model recommendations\n- Phase 2: pill reset-position monitor-strategy preference (IPC + UI)\n- Phase 4: admin-on-startup elevation toggle (Windows)\n- Phase 1: native pill ring/radius redesign (dash-shimmer ring, inflate-aware radius, Satoshi flash font)\n- Rust follow-ups: regenerate specta bindings; remove now-unused cloud auth commands"
