+      "description": "## Summary\n\nAdds a complete one-page marketing site for mausVoice at `marketing/index.html` (single HTML file + self-contained assets), built from a monochrome black/white template and adapted with the repo's real design system and product assets.\n\n## What's included\n\n**Design system**\n- Pure black/white monochrome with HSL tokens, liquid-glass surfaces\n- Self-hosted fonts: **Satoshi** (primary, from `apps/desktop`), Inter, **TAN-PARADISO** (italic accent words + nav wordmark), JetBrains Mono\n- Condensed display headings, fadeUp + word-by-word scroll reveals\n\n**Sections**\n- Fixed transparent navbar with the real logo (original colors) and GitHub/docs/releases buttons\n- Full-viewport hero: black background texture, headline, download form, and a **live recording pill** — a 1:1 canvas replica of the app's sine-wave algorithm (ported from `packages/rust_macos_pill` / `AudioWaveform.tsx`), rendered at 675.4×182.4px\n- \"Typing has changed\" — macOS / Windows / Linux cards (official icons) linking to the releases page, each with 3D ASCII art\n- Mission — real screen-capture demo video + scroll word reveal\n- Product — app screenshot band + 4 feature cards with 3D ASCII art\n- CTA over black background, footer with legal links\n\n**Assets** (all real, from the repo)\n- Screenshots from `docs/`, screen-capture videos converted from GIFs\n- Monochrome OG card, favicon, AI-generated black background textures\n\n**Housekeeping**\n- `.gitignore` now covers the fetched design skill kits (`.humanize`, `.impeccable`, `.taste`, `.brandkit`, `.emilkowalski`, `.ui-ux-pro-max`, `.design-md`, `.motion-ui`) — fetched locally, never committed\n\n## Preview\n\nServe `marketing/` with any static server (e.g. `python3 -m http.server`) and open `index.html`.\n\n## Notes\n\n- No framework/build step: single HTML + CSS + JS file, no external requests (fonts self-hosted).\n- Respects `prefers-reduced-motion` (static pill frame, no reveals) with a noscript fallback."
