+      "description": "## Summary\n\nReplaces the upstream multi-channel release stack with a single, robust mausVoice release pipeline, and cleans up stale fork artifacts. **Stacks on PR #11** (base `arena/019fee66-voquill`) — merge into #11, then #11 carries it to main together with the README redesign (#13).\n\n**New release pipeline (`.github/workflows/release.yml`):**\n- `workflow_dispatch`-based: enter version + optional notes, hit run\n- 3-platform matrix: macOS universal, Windows, Linux (deb + AppImage)\n- Unsigned, throwaway-key build (no signing keys exist in this repo — only `GROQ_API_KEY`)\n- Version synced into `package.json` / `tauri.conf.json` / `tauri.prod.conf.json`\n- Polished release body via `scripts/ci/generate-release-body.mjs`: title, tagline, **What's new** (auto from commits since last `mausVoice-v*` tag, or manual notes), **Downloads** table, per-platform install steps, unsigned disclaimer, footer links\n- Release authored by the maintainer's PAT (`RELEASE_TOKEN` secret, falls back to `GITHUB_TOKEN`) so releases show **Owie6789**\n- No updater channel metadata (throwaway key is repo-visible)\n- `docs/RELEASE.md` runbook replaces `docs/desktop-release.md`\n\n**Deleted (upstream cruft referencing nonexistent secrets):**\n- `release.yml` 3-channel orchestrator, `_release-desktop-impl.yml` (954 lines), `release-enterprise-admin/gateway.yml`, `release-docs.yml`, `retry-release.yml`, `publish-packages.yml`, `release-unsigned.yml`\n- Orphaned `scripts/ci/prepare-tauri-release.mjs`, `collect-tauri-artifacts.mjs`, `set-tauri-release-config.mjs`\n\n**Stale fork artifacts removed:**\n- `enterprise/` (admin + gateway, 2.9MB) + its tauri confs, workflow refs, pnpm-workspace glob, sonar sources\n- `README.original.md` + sonar exclusion\n- `personal-fork-ci/` synced (build/lint templates only), merge inventory marked historical\n\n## Quality\n\n- SonarCloud gate **OK** (security + maintainability green; fixed 7× S7630 injection blockers, S6505, 26× minors)\n- Build/lint/tests passing on the stacked base"
