+## Obstacles
+
+Occurrence counts below are **lower bounds from cited examples**, not exhaustive counts or independent verification of every author's claim.
+
+| Obstacle | Occurrences | Example PRs | Suggested Mitigation |
+|---|---:|---|---|
+| Real models and native runtimes need large artifacts, network access and compatible toolchains; synthetic tests were misleading. | At least 3 PRs | [#40](https://github.com/maus-inc/mausVoice/pull/40) requires runtime binaries and weights; [#42](https://github.com/maus-inc/mausVoice/pull/42) makes multi-GB E2E opt-in; [#103](https://github.com/maus-inc/mausVoice/pull/103) reports no reachable Rust toolchain. | Provide pre-provisioned, pinned toolchains and a scheduled artifact-backed ASR smoke suite; retain fast offline negative tests. |
